src/lifecycle.ts, src/discovery.ts and src/sender.ts are extracted from
src/features/huddle/ in that revision. Imports and application-specific types
were replaced with local contracts. src/controller.ts adapts service.ts's
single-call lifetime, late-result cancellation, mute and heartbeat behavior
to injected host adapters. src/types.ts adapts the bridge and audio contracts.

src/web-audio/index.ts adapts src/features/huddle/audio.ts to a standalone
adapter with a packaged AudioWorklet URL and no device settings owner.
playout.ts and capture.worklet.js are extracted from the same upstream
directory. Changes include finite-sample checks, idempotent playout cleanup,
late-permission cancellation and processor-failure cleanup.

src/relay/ adapts the HTTP admission, event construction and connection lifetime
from the same buzz-app revision. Its audio handshake and v2 packet layout are
adapted from crates/buzz-audio-client/{connection,wire,encoder}.rs in block/buzz
revision 630922a9e1f891380a61f5b7d726d05ca948cc64 (Apache-2.0, Copyright 2026
Block, Inc.). The implementation replaces native TLS/Opus/NetEQ ownership with
injected WebSocket and codec hosts, independent signature verification and
bounded fixed PCM playout. src/webcodecs/ provides a separate browser codec.

src/agent-voice/ adapts the AI voice-seat lifetime in buzz-app's
src/features/huddle/voice.ts and AgentVoiceSeat/AgentVoiceConnection contracts.
Changes include a provider-independent one-user/one-AI pipe, response IDs for
interruption, final transcript events and explicit host session cancellation.
The included test provider generates tones and synthetic transcript fixtures;
it is not an AI model, speech recognizer or speech synthesizer.

src/codex-voice/ and scripts/codex-rpc.mjs adapt bundled/codex/voice.ts and
rpc.ts from the same revision. Changes include a browser/Node boundary,
local thread ownership, final transcripts, data-channel interruption,
worklet generation fencing and owned process-group cleanup.

Buzz UI, artwork, other agent integrations and application relay implementations
are not included. Upstream NOTICE.md's asset and other-feature attributions
do not pertain to the extracted files.

